cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project, please cite it as below."
title: "FuzzyCountries: a fuzzy-logic socioeconomic model for 49 countries"
abstract: >-
  A fuzzy-logic model of 49 countries built with Ciao Prolog and RFuzzy, with a
  Python reference implementation, data-quality audit, automated tests and a
  Power BI star-schema export. The model uses 28 socioeconomic indicators, 26
  piecewise-linear membership functions and 17 rules to produce transparent
  country scores for concepts such as clean country, developed country,
  economically stable country and quality healthcare.
authors:
